# Reuse-first instruction

Before implementing any major module, inspect `docs/07_GITHUB_REUSE_RESEARCH.md`.

For each dependency:

1. Verify current repository activity.
2. Verify package manager availability.
3. Verify license compatibility.
4. Verify security/advisory status.
5. Prefer official SDKs for Twilio/Apple/Android/platform functionality.
6. Never copy code from AGPL/GPL repositories into a closed-source app without legal approval.
7. For crypto, prefer proven audited libraries/protocols and require specialist review before production.
